+## AGV2-001 — Cold start normal action denied
+
+Given a cold runtime snapshot.  
+When `PLACE_ORDER` is evaluated.  
+Then the verdict is denied and includes:
+
+- `allowed=false`
+- `decision=deny`
+- `reason=bootstrap_not_reconciled`
