+Evidence: `tests/scenarios/core-action-gate-verdict.ts`
+
+## AGV2-002 — ExchangeTruth unknown denied
+
+Given bootstrap and position are reconciled, but ExchangeTruth remains unknown.  
+When `PLACE_ORDER` is evaluated.  
